  "headline": "Prabowo Subianto To Submit Two Vice President Names To MPR",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Subianto To Submit Two Vice President Names To MPR",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto plans to deliver two vice presidential candidate names to the MPR on November 25, amid ongoing verification processes.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto is scheduled to present two candidates for the vice presidency to the MPR on November 25.",
    "The MPR has established three working groups to conduct thorough field and document verification for the potential candidates.",
    "Proposed regulations suggest that once nominated by the President, candidates will not be permitted to withdraw from the selection process."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The process to select a replacement vice president for Gibran has intensified as the MPR prepares for the upcoming presentation of two candidates by President Prabowo Subianto on November 25. To ensure integrity and transparency, the MPR has formed three specialized working groups tasked with conducting field investigations and validating official documents. The Corruption Eradication Commission (KPK) has expressed openness to assisting the verification team during this period. Discussions surrounding the criteria for these candidates include requirements for presenting formal proposals during MPR sessions and the necessity of regional representation. Meanwhile, political observers have noted various figures being discussed as potential contenders in the search for a new vice president, while the MPR has emphasized that candidates will be barred from withdrawing once they are officially nominated by the President to prevent disruptions to the selection timeline.",
